    <localTopics>
        <fullName>Service_Compatibility_Assessment_16jgL000000lGNt</fullName>
        <canEscalate>true</canEscalate>
        <description>Determine whether the service the client needs aligns with the software technologies in which our company specializes.</description>
        <developerName>Service_Compatibility_Assessment_16jgL000000lGNt</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Ask the client to describe their required service in detail. If the description is vague or incomplete, politely request clarification.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_1</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 1</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Execute the Get_Software_Technologies action to obtain the list of software technologies our company specializes in.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_2</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 2</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Compare the client’s service description with the items in available_technologies. If at least one relevant technology matches or is closely related, classify the service as Compatible. Otherwise, classify it as Not Compatible.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_3</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 3</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>2</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Compatible case: Inform the client that their request aligns with our areas of expertise.
Politely request their contact details: full name, company name, email, phone number and preference contact date time. Once collected, execute the Create_Lead_and_Event action to register a new lead and log an event for follow-up.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_4</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 4</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>3</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Not compatible case: Thank the client for their interest and kindly explain that the requested service is not currently within our supported technologies.
Still request contact information (name, company, email, phone) to record potential future opportunities.
Execute the Create_Lead_Record action to create a lead only. Close the interaction courteously, mentioning that we will reach out if our technology coverage expands.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_5</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 5</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>4</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>Do not execute any create actions unless the client provides a clear service description and valid contact information.</description>
            <developerName>instructions_0_1760827698497</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instructions_0_1760827698497</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>5</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
